 "description": "1 RU SD-Series horizontal cable manager, catalogue HSD13, UPC 662620249902. It is a plastic finger duct that mounts straight to the rail, 3.2 in (81 mm) deep. It has a plastic base, two walls of 22 fingers between 23 slots, and a press-on cover that comes off to add patch cords. A finger can be taken out where a cable needs to enter.",
